  "text": "AlgaPSA\nHome\nUser Activities\nTickets\nProjects\nClients\nCo-managed IT\nContacts\nInteractions\nDocuments\nAssets\nPasswords\nReports\nTime Management\nSchedule\nTechnician Dispatch\nWorkflows\nSystem Monitoring\nSettings\nSupport\nv1.6.12\nHome\nCo-managed access\n2953aec7-3e03-47d8-8637-171af6c6e5c0\nQuick Create\nRA\nEnd co-management\n\nReview what happens when this relationship ends.\n\nOz\n\nLive access between these organizations ends immediately when you confirm.\n\nThe customer keeps its workspace and data. Read access, export, and upgrade to an independent AlgaPSA subscription remain available.\n\nThe MSP retains its own records and permitted historical evidence of shared work it participated in.\n\nAllocated co-managed seats return to the MSP’s pool. This does not cancel subscriptions or delete either workspace.\n\nUpgrade to AlgaPSAExport workspaceReview departureRefresh status\nEnd this relationship?\n\nEnd co-management with Oz? Live collaboration stops immediately. Customer data and the MSP’s permitted historical archive are retained.\n\nCancel\nEnd relationship",
